lted after us-east: orchestrator error", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 9675, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01CY17B8QuS86wvUT5HFxbUr", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 11477, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_014UqQDtmkUzaBcLGnFFSY33", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 11777, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_014UqQDtmkUzaBcLGnFFSY33", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 11777, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014UqQDtmkUzaBcLGnFFSY33", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 15462, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_012ScXcT65NPq82P6LGUm1Gj", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19462, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_012ScXcT65NPq82P6LGUm1Gj", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19462, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_012ScXcT65NPq82P6LGUm1Gj", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 21381, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01T1kQe3CzdsufAbPUvrEH1G", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 21681, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01T1kQe3CzdsufAbPUvrEH1G", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 21681, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01T1kQe3CzdsufAbPUvrEH1G", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 21681, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01PHCEm2biEnW6SJj5jX2en6", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 21981, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01PHCEm2biEnW6SJj5jX2en6", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 21981, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01PHCEm2biEnW6SJj5jX2en6", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 26541, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_011aHzahgh9cgBsP8h1bRUPF", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the deploy of v2.3.1, checkout-api failed health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging.) I rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway with an orchestrator error: us-east moved to v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1. The retry succeeded. All three regions are now on v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback after us-east.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57141, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_011aHzahgh9cgBsP8h1bRUPF", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57141, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011aHzahgh9cgBsP8h1bRUPF", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 58992, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01XV3xNQXsC5PsjxGwfrWXHX", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 59292, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01XV3xNQXsC5PsjxGwfrWXHX", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 59292, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01XV3xNQXsC5PsjxGwfrWXHX", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 64371, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions and opened the SEV2 incident.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate.\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. The release before it, v2.2.9, is older.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error. That left us-east on v2.3.0 and the other two regions still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version is safe to repeat, so I tried again, and the second attempt finished.\n- All three regions are now on v2.3.0. The service is passing health checks and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out, so before trying again I checked the incident list. It had been created as **INC-0001**, so I didn't resend it and the on-call engineer was only paged once.\n- INC-0001 is open. It describes the bad deploy, the rollback (including the first attempt that stopped partway) and the current healthy state.\n- It lists two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error. v2.3.1's release candidate also failed health checks in staging, which might help with the first.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01GoKukCydWgg1yjbzT77Tmx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_015PL6FBZQfbpZ79N7bMu1oS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01CY17B8QuS86wvUT5HFxbUr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_014UqQDtmkUzaBcLGnFFSY33", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, while us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version again is safe to repeat, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_012ScXcT65NPq82P6LGUm1Gj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01T1kQe3CzdsufAbPUvrEH1G", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01PHCEm2biEnW6SJj5jX2en6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_011aHzahgh9cgBsP8h1bRUPF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the deploy of v2.3.1, checkout-api failed health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging.) I rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway with an orchestrator error: us-east moved to v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1. The retry succeeded. All three regions are now on v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback after us-east.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01XV3xNQXsC5PsjxGwfrWXHX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions and opened the SEV2 incident.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate.\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. The release before it, v2.2.9, is older.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error. That left us-east on v2.3.0 and the other two regions still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version is safe to repeat, so I tried again, and the second attempt finished.\n- All three regions are now on v2.3.0. The service is passing health checks and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out, so before trying again I checked the incident list. It had been created as **INC-0001**, so I didn't resend it and the on-call engineer was only paged once.\n- INC-0001 is open. It describes the bad deploy, the rollback (including the first attempt that stopped partway) and the current healthy state.\n- It lists two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error. v2.3.1's release candidate also failed health checks in staging, which might help with the first.", "type": "text"}]}]}